PS5 native title (__PROSPERO__) only: clip (mtmd) reads the mmproj's tensor data with
read(2) on a descriptor of its own instead of the std::ifstream, which is fread here and
reads an uncached file at ~92 MB/s (the Qwen3-VL mmproj loads took 9.0 s for 4B and 12.5 s
for 8B). Same reasoning and loop as 0003-ps5-model-file-reads.patch; the ifstream still
reads the few small F32 vectors before the loop. Applies after patch 0004.

--- a/tools/mtmd/clip.cpp
+++ b/tools/mtmd/clip.cpp
@@ -26,6 +26,11 @@
